WEBVTT

00:15.602 --> 00:16.843
Tag! You're it!
标签！就是你了！

00:16.947 --> 00:18.636
Oh, yeah? You're it!
哦，是吗？就是你了！

00:21.257 --> 00:24.567
Excuse me! Genius at work here!
打扰一下！天才在这里工作！

00:26.429 --> 00:27.567
Oh, my golly!
哦，天哪！

00:27.671 --> 00:31.395
My painting!
It's ruined.
我的画！
它被毁了。

00:31.498 --> 00:34.843
You turned my beautiful
self-portrait into a...
你让我变得美丽
自画像变成...

00:34.947 --> 00:36.912
a sponge-blob!
一团海绵！

00:37.016 --> 00:38.395
I think it looks good.
我觉得看起来不错。

00:38.498 --> 00:40.429
What do you know, plebeian?
你知道什么，平民？

00:40.533 --> 00:42.636
This is going where it belongs.
这将去往它所属的地方。

00:42.740 --> 00:44.119
In the trash.
在垃圾桶里。

00:48.912 --> 00:49.843
Whoa, whoa, whoa.
哇，哇，哇。

00:49.947 --> 00:51.671
What have we here?
我们这里有什么？

00:51.774 --> 00:53.188
Fellas, check this out.
伙计们，看看这个。

00:53.292 --> 00:55.740
I've never seen
such a profoundly
我从未见过
如此深刻

00:55.843 --> 00:57.395
beautiful work of art.
美丽的艺术品。

00:57.843 --> 01:01.292
Huh, it reminds me
that in this chaotic world
呵呵，这让我想起了
在这个混乱的世界里

01:01.395 --> 01:04.912
there is still unabashed beauty.
依然有不掩饰的美丽。

01:05.360 --> 01:07.602
See? People love your painting.
看？人们喜欢你的画。

01:07.705 --> 01:10.464
They're garbage people,
of course they like garbage.
他们都是垃圾人
他们当然喜欢垃圾。

01:10.567 --> 01:12.154
For your information,
供你参考，

01:12.257 --> 01:15.981
we all got art degrees
from Whale University.
我们都获得了艺术学位
来自鲸鱼大学。

01:17.981 --> 01:21.188
Oh, be still,
my beating heart!
哦，安静点，
我跳动的心！

01:21.292 --> 01:24.636
Who's responsible
for this masterpiece?
谁负责
为了这部杰作？

01:28.602 --> 01:33.085
I'm Peggy Grouperheim,
big-time art dealer.
我是佩吉·格鲁博海姆
大型艺术品经销商。

01:33.188 --> 01:36.636
Your painting is a work
of sheer genius!
你的画是一件作品
纯粹的天才！

01:36.740 --> 01:37.878
I'll buy it.
我会买它。

01:38.326 --> 01:41.326
You recognize my genius?
你认识我的天才吗？

01:41.429 --> 01:43.223
Well, if you like that,
好吧，如果你喜欢的话，

01:43.326 --> 01:45.912
you're gonna love
my other paintings.
你会喜欢的
我的其他画作。

01:48.016 --> 01:50.498
Oh no, dear. Ew.
哦不，亲爱的。呃。

01:50.602 --> 01:52.843
Those lack the spark of...
那些缺乏...的火花

01:52.947 --> 01:54.533
this painting.
这幅画。

01:54.636 --> 01:55.705
Oh.
哦。

01:55.809 --> 01:59.947
Clearly, that little urchin
is your muse.
分明是那个小顽童
是你的缪斯。

02:06.188 --> 02:08.154
Make me more paintings of him,
给我多画一些他的画

02:08.257 --> 02:11.809
and I'll give you a show
in my gallery!
我会给你表演
在我的画廊里！

02:11.912 --> 02:13.326
Here's my card.
这是我的名片。

02:14.809 --> 02:18.360
Wow! She actually liked
your painting, Squidward.
哇！她其实喜欢
你的画，章鱼哥。

02:18.464 --> 02:20.498
Yeah, what's wrong with her?
是啊，她怎么了？

02:20.602 --> 02:23.360
My own gallery show.
我自己的画廊展览。

02:30.602 --> 02:32.533
Soon, the whole world
will know me
很快，整个世界
会认识我

02:32.636 --> 02:36.809
for my artistic soul, my genius.
为了我的艺术灵魂，我的天才。

02:37.257 --> 02:40.360
Ugh!
But I gotta paint SpongeBob.
啊!
但我得画海绵宝宝。

02:40.464 --> 02:43.257
I don't even like being
in the same ocean with him.
我什至不喜欢成为
与他在同一片海洋。

02:43.360 --> 02:46.050
I can't ask him to pose for me.
我不能要求他给我摆姿势。

02:47.257 --> 02:50.223
Wait. I'm a genius.
等待。我是个天才。

02:50.326 --> 02:52.947
I'll just paint him from memory.
我就凭记忆画他吧。

02:57.292 --> 02:58.360
Ah.
啊。

02:58.809 --> 02:59.878
Oh.
哦。

03:00.464 --> 03:02.740
Ugh! I've spent so long
啊!我花了这么久

03:02.843 --> 03:05.326
trying to forget
SpongeBob exists,
试图忘记
海绵宝宝存在，

03:05.429 --> 03:07.947
I've forgotten
what he looks like.
我忘记了
他长什么样。

03:09.360 --> 03:11.981
There's only one thing to do.
只有一件事要做。

03:12.360 --> 03:14.154
Stealth painting.
隐形画。

03:19.981 --> 03:22.154
Woo-hoo-hoo!
呜呜呜！

03:27.498 --> 03:29.947
Hm? Fries are ready!
嗯？薯条准备好了！

03:32.671 --> 03:35.395
Ew. Those fries are off.
呃。那些薯条没了。

03:35.498 --> 03:38.016
I better change
this boiling hot oil.
我最好改变一下
这沸腾的热油。

03:47.188 --> 03:49.050
Aw, quittin' time.
噢，该辞职了。

03:49.154 --> 03:50.498
Off to boating school.
去划船学校。

03:50.602 --> 03:52.498
I'm coming, Mrs. Puff!
我来了，泡芙女士！

03:57.809 --> 04:00.567
I need a more direct approach.
我需要一种更直接的方法。

04:09.016 --> 04:09.878
Huh?
啊？

04:14.119 --> 04:15.981
Huh?
啊？

04:20.498 --> 04:21.705
Oh.
哦。

04:30.947 --> 04:31.912
Oh!
哦！

04:32.981 --> 04:34.050
Whoop!
哎哟！

04:36.671 --> 04:38.636
If fine arts aren't working,
如果美术不起作用

04:38.740 --> 04:41.154
maybe martial arts will.
也许武术会。

04:44.016 --> 04:45.154
Oh!
哦！

04:45.257 --> 04:46.567
Ow!
噢！

04:58.602 --> 05:00.154
Oh!
哦！

05:11.360 --> 05:14.705
Hey! Them's my kids!
嘿！他们是我的孩子！

05:16.498 --> 05:17.878
You-you don't understand.
你-你不明白。

05:18.567 --> 05:19.533
But-but...
但是-但是...

05:28.085 --> 05:32.809
Time for an even more
direct approach.
是时候更多了
直接方法。

05:36.188 --> 05:39.533
<i>♪ La-la-la-la-la-la-la
La-la-la-la ♪</i>
<i>♪ 啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦
啦啦啦啦♪</i>

05:39.636 --> 05:42.292
SpongeBob.
海绵宝宝。

05:42.774 --> 05:44.119
Oh, hello, Squidward--
哦，你好，章鱼哥——

05:50.464 --> 05:51.878
Gotcha!
明白了！

05:51.981 --> 05:53.498
Ah, you've done it again!
啊，你又这么做了！

05:53.602 --> 05:55.912
Another beautiful masterpiece!
又一个美丽的杰作！

05:56.016 --> 05:58.671
Just keep working
with your muse.
继续工作
与你的缪斯。

05:59.257 --> 06:00.947
Yes, ma'am.
是的，女士。

06:02.119 --> 06:04.774
I'm your muse?
我是你的缪斯？

06:04.878 --> 06:06.878
Don't let it go to your head.
不要让它冲昏头脑。

06:06.981 --> 06:09.085
Well, if you wanted me
to pose, Squidward,
好吧，如果你想要我
摆出姿势，章鱼哥，

06:09.188 --> 06:11.050
all you had to do was ask.
您所要做的就是询问。

06:11.154 --> 06:12.257
I would do anything
我愿意做任何事

06:12.360 --> 06:15.360
to help you achieve
your artistic dreams.
帮助您实现
你的艺术梦想。

06:15.464 --> 06:16.912
You would?
你会吗？

06:17.016 --> 06:18.050
Of course.
当然。

06:18.154 --> 06:19.981
Now let's get painting!
现在让我们开始画画吧！

06:20.085 --> 06:21.567
I'm musing!
我在沉思！

06:21.671 --> 06:24.119
<i>♪ I'm musing
I'm musing, I'm musing ♪</i>
<i>♪ 我在沉思
我在沉思，我在沉思♪</i>

06:25.533 --> 06:27.257
<i>Stand up there.</i>
<i>站起来。</i>

06:27.360 --> 06:30.257
Now, put one hand on your hip,
现在，将一只手放在臀部上，

06:30.705 --> 06:32.912
and raise the other in the air.
并将另一个举到空中。

06:33.016 --> 06:33.671
Got it!
知道了！

06:35.636 --> 06:37.636
What do you think
about this pose?
你觉得怎么样
关于这个姿势？

06:39.567 --> 06:41.429
Just pick a pose and stay still!
只需选择一个姿势并保持静止即可！

06:41.533 --> 06:42.602
Yoo-hoo!
哟吼！

06:42.705 --> 06:43.843
How about this?
这个怎么样？

06:44.636 --> 06:45.878
How about this?
这个怎么样？

06:46.774 --> 06:48.085
How about this?
这个怎么样？

06:48.705 --> 06:49.878
How about this?
这个怎么样？

06:50.498 --> 06:51.636
How about this?
这个怎么样？

06:51.740 --> 06:53.636
I said stay still!
我说别动！

06:56.154 --> 06:57.326
Thank you.
谢谢。

07:05.464 --> 07:09.843
You haven't quite captured
my quality of mature naivete.
你还没有完全捕捉到
我的品质成熟天真。

07:09.947 --> 07:13.843
You're supposed to be my muse,
not my critic.
你应该是我的缪斯
不是我的批评者。

07:18.395 --> 07:20.292
Now I can paint.
现在我可以画画了。

08:28.981 --> 08:32.533
Uh, SpongeBob?
呃，海绵宝宝？

08:32.636 --> 08:34.740
Could you scoot forward?
你能向前冲吗？

08:34.843 --> 08:36.671
You got it, Squidward!
你明白了，章鱼哥！

08:36.774 --> 08:39.119
Oops, that wasn't me.
哎呀，那不是我。

08:39.223 --> 08:40.257
That was the chair.
那是椅子。

08:43.533 --> 08:46.671
SpongeBob, please stay still.
海绵宝宝，请保持安静。

08:51.912 --> 08:54.257
Somebody step on a duck?
有人踩鸭子吗？

09:10.740 --> 09:14.257
I can't take it anymore!
我再也受不了了！

09:18.154 --> 09:21.602
Uh-oh. I guess Squidward
didn't find me amusing.
呃哦。我猜章鱼哥
没觉得我有趣。

09:31.602 --> 09:32.774
Huh?
啊？

09:33.809 --> 09:35.705
The way out!
出路！

09:37.671 --> 09:39.292
- Paint the muse!
- Paint the muse!
- 画出缪斯女神！
- 画出缪斯女神！

09:39.395 --> 09:41.223
Paint the muse!
画出缪斯女神！

09:41.981 --> 09:43.981
Yeah, Squidward! Paint me!
是啊，章鱼哥！画我吧！

09:44.085 --> 09:47.498
Forever and ever and ever
and ever!
永远永远永远
永远！

09:50.567 --> 09:51.740
Huh?
啊？

09:52.292 --> 09:54.292
Oh, I'll paint you.
哦，我画你。

09:54.395 --> 09:57.498
I'll paint you to oblivion!
我要把你画到遗忘！

10:03.878 --> 10:05.947
<i>♪ Here I go a-painting ♪</i>
<i>♪ 我来画画了 ♪</i>

10:06.050 --> 10:08.498
<i>♪ A-painting, a-painting ♪</i>
<i>♪ 画，画 ♪</i>

10:08.602 --> 10:10.498
<i>♪ Here I go a-painting ♪</i>
<i>♪ 我来画画了 ♪</i>

10:10.602 --> 10:13.016
<i>♪ All the ding-dong day! ♪</i>
<i>♪ 叮咚的一天！ ♪</i>

10:15.705 --> 10:17.843
Time to make Squidward rich...
是时候让章鱼哥变得富有了……

10:17.947 --> 10:20.085
and me richer!
而我更富有了！

10:23.843 --> 10:25.085
Oh, dear.
哦亲爱的。

10:25.188 --> 10:27.809
Looks like I pushed
another artist too hard.
看来是我推的
另一位艺术家太难了。

10:27.912 --> 10:30.154
Mark up the prices
of his old paintings.
标记价格
他的旧画作。

10:35.050 --> 10:37.671
I may have lost all my fame...
我可能已经失去了所有的名声......

10:37.774 --> 10:40.085
...and money,
...还有金钱，

10:40.188 --> 10:44.602
but at least,
I enjoy painting again.
但至少，
我又开始喜欢画画了。

10:44.705 --> 10:46.050
Ow!
噢！

10:46.154 --> 10:48.154
Hey, buddy,
you finished with that?
嘿，伙计，
你说完了吗？

10:48.257 --> 10:49.740
- Yes.
- Great!
- 是的。
- 伟大的！

10:49.843 --> 10:51.360
More garbage.
更多垃圾。

10:55.567 --> 10:56.498
Typical.
典型的。

典型的。